1. WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

This licence covers the parts of MindOS that Black Arrow wrote: the compositor
(`mindwm`), the desktop shell (`mindshell`), the mind daemon and CLI (`mindd`,
`mind`), the MindOS packages under `packages/` other than `linux-mindos` and
`paru`, the installer, the ISO profile, the artwork, the theme, the icons and
cursors, the documentation, and the MindOS name and logo. These are the
"Software".

This licence does NOT cover the third-party software MindOS is built from or
ships alongside: the Linux kernel, the Arch Linux packages, the fonts, the
language model, the Rust and system libraries, and everything else listed in
`THIRD-PARTY.md`. Each of those keeps its own licence, and nothing in this
document adds a restriction to any of them. Where a component is licensed under
the GNU GPL, the LGPL, or any other licence that grants you rights this one does
not, that licence governs that component and your rights under it are untouched.
See `THIRD-PARTY.md`, which also tells you how to get the source code for those
components.


